## 🧩 Summary
EasyEatz focuses on accessibility, speed, and simplicity. It’s more than just a recipe site — it’s a cooking companion for real life. By supporting busy students, new cooks, and working parents, EasyEatz helps people eat better, save time, and gain confidence in the kitchen.
